# Apache configuration for the prerendered static build.
#
# Lives in client/public/ so vite copies it into dist/public on every build.
# It was previously added by hand to the deploy branch only, which meant any
# rebuild of that branch silently dropped it.
#
# No SPA rewrite here on purpose. scripts/prerender.mjs writes every one of the
# application's routes to <route>/index.html, so Apache's ordinary file and
# directory resolution already serves them. Rewriting unmatched paths to
# /index.html — which this file used to do — answers every unknown URL with
# HTTP 200 and the homepage, a soft 404 that search engines index as a real
# page. ErrorDocument returns the prerendered 404 page with a genuine 404
# status instead, matching the express handler in server/_core/vite.ts that the
# e2e suite exercises.

Options -Indexes

ErrorDocument 404 /404.html
